// ============================================================
// THE FIFTEEN BORROWING ROUTES.
//
// Each one generates its own page at /portal/alt-credit/:slug. The body is
// written as paragraphs rather than bullets, because the reader is a practice
// owner deciding whether to put a property at risk and a bullet list cannot
// carry a qualification.
//
// `depth: "full"` means the route has the long-form treatment: the mechanics
// of underwriting as the lender actually runs them, several worked examples
// with real figures, the questions people actually search, and a risk table
// with likelihood bands. `depth: "structured"` means the same shape at lower
// resolution, pending a later research pass — and the page says which it is,
// rather than letting a thin page pass as a thorough one.
// ============================================================

