    underwritingMechanics: ["Owner-occupancy is the gate. Confirm the required percentage on sba.gov before spending anything.", "504: bank first mortgage plus a Certified Development Company second, for long-term fixed assets.", "7(a): broader, can include working capital alongside the real estate.", "Loans are made by participating lenders; the SBA guarantees and publishes a lender match service.", "Personal guarantees are generally required despite the entity structure.", "Prepayment penalties apply on 504 through the early years."],
